{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116600","id":3311372422,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7FX4iG","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116600","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116600.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116600.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116600","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116600/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116600/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116600/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7285ca00e7eb7a8c456cb48c964d31eeaef04a64","number":116600,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Expose VoxelGI bake progress via signals","user":{"login":"TitanNano","id":4500858,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MDA4NTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4500858?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano","html_url":"https://github.com/TitanNano","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TitanNano/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14242.\r\n\r\nCurrently the progress of `VoxelGI::bake` is reported via three C++ function pointers:\r\n\r\n- `VoxelGI::bake_begin_function`\r\n- `VoxelGI::bake_step_function`\r\n- `VoxelGI::bake_end_function`\r\n\r\nThese functions can only be set by engine code and are currently only utilized by the editor to display a progress bar.\r\n\r\nAnyone calling `VoxelGI::bake` via `GDScript` or `GDExtension` is unable to observe the progress of the bake process. I would like to keep track of the progress that has been made while baking a node. Being able to observe the progress would allow for more responsive UI updates in games that bake VoxelGI at runtime; i.e., progress bars can be updated more granularly (see caveats regarding remaining limitations).\r\n\r\nIt will also enable editor plugins to display the baking progress when implementing custom processes like batch processing.\r\n\r\n[example_project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25461030/example_project.zip) that demonstrates the new signals.\r\n\r\n## Caveats\r\nThe editor currently utilizes a bit of a hack to update the progress bar when receiving the step function callback. It manually runs the main loop for a few iterations as the VoxelGI bake process is completely blocking the main thread. This limitation will not be removed by migrating to signals but can be addressed in later changes like this proposal: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14243.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https: